  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></math> be a differentiable function for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> equals :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Differentiating with respect to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p><p>Integrate both the sides we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><menclose notation=\"right\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></menclose><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msubsup><menclose notation=\"right\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></menclose><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> &nbsp; {as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>}</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
  }
